sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Task
    participant Sch as Scheduler
    participant RQ as Run queue
    participant CG as cgroup limits
    participant CPU as CPU
    T->>RQ: becomes runnable
    Sch->>RQ: pick_next_task across classes in strict order
    Note over Sch: deadline, then real-time, then CFS — a lower class only runs when the ones above are empty
    Sch->>CG: does this task's group have budget left?
    alt quota remaining
        CG-->>Sch: allowed
        Sch->>CPU: context switch in
        CPU-->>T: runs until its slice ends or it blocks
    else quota exhausted
        CG->>T: throttled until the period refills
        Note over CG,T: throttling looks exactly like a slow dependency from inside the container
    end
